                        <div id="page-title">
                            中国分部异常项目
                        </div>
                    

                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        

<p><strong>前言：</strong>SCP基金会中国分部发现了为数不少的项目无用而不值得进一步关注。本文件列出了那些激起了一些好奇心的项目。如果这些项目的知识在将来变得有用或必要，则可以将其作为一种资源。<br />
— █████博士，Site-CN-██研究主管</p>
<p>欲查看已归档的异常项目记录，请<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn-arc">点击这里</a>。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button create-button" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00483/parentPage/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/#_editpage">添加新的记录</a></p>
</div>
    
    
    
    </div>
<p style="text-align: center;">显示顺序：<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating%20desc">评分较高</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating">评分较低</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name">最早发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name%20desc">最新发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/random">随机</a></p>
<p><strong>提示：</strong>如果你希望改变你的评分，请先点击“X”取消你的评分，再重新评分。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一行带有模因的文字，会使观察者产生极度反感并拒绝记忆位于与项目之前的内容。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>各类书籍<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>未被完全收容<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">以下为一个典型范例</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">收起</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<h3><span>要求全文背诵</span></h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00335" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00335-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608320814" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1595921948 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Jul 2020 07:39</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00185/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一辆与██品牌共享单车无异的共享单车，其异常性质在于车辆标牌无法被电子设备识别，且无涂抹痕迹。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>吉林省██市██路██商场门口<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>就近收容于Site-CN-05低价值物品收容区<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>成像非常清晰，但就是识别不上，气得半死。一一研究员Miku ████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00185" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00185" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00185-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku-maekawa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3522164); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3522164&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608320814" alt="Miku Maekawa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3522164)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku-maekawa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3522164); return false;">Miku Maekawa</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589269677 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 May 2020 07:47</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00289/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>50ml没有质量的水<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2021/█/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██的一间收容室外半空中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>飘浮于Site-CN-██Dr.Redef的桌旁</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>笔记：</strong>从监控可以发现，它在那飘了2个多小时了，为什么没人发现? ——站点主管████<br />
但它挺可爱的，不是吗？——Dr.Redef</p>
</blockquote>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00289" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00289" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00289-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-redef" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3765822); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3765822&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608320814" alt="Dr redef" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3765822)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-redef" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3765822); return false;">Dr redef</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1593264526 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">27 Jun 2020 13:28</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00111/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张████餐馆的菜单，任何人类在观察项目时，项目上的菜品都会变成此人最喜欢吃的东西，当有人在菜品后的方框中打勾时，此人的面前就会出现刚刚勾选的菜品<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市████餐馆中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于site—██的食堂中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>嘿，终于不用忍受食堂那可怕的饭菜了！</em>——Dr.pigeon</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+实验记录</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;实验记录1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>当使用机器人在菜单上勾选时，会在空中出现一行字：“机器人不用吃饭”语言随观察者而变化</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00111" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00111" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00111-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608320814" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587805117 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 Apr 2020 08:58</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00204/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>由██国产的一部华█手机。当有非该国国籍的人手持该项目，并以夸张的表情和语气说出夸赞有关该国的话时，该项目会变成一部iP█one手机。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>一名俄罗斯籍男子手中。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被保存于Site-CN-57中的一个低危异常储存柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我一直支持国产！嘿！S█ri，我的█文好吗？——Fula████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00204" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00204" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00204-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6127045&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608320814" alt="Dr Fishbone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6127045)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;">Dr Fishbone</a></span></p>
